                            <comment id="15114200" author="samaitra" created="Sun, 24 Jan 2016 04:50:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=s.kozlov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;s.kozlov&quot;&gt;s.kozlov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dmagda&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dmagda&quot;&gt;dmagda&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Sergey,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is a difference when I run ignite.sh from apache-ignite-fabric-1.5.0.final-bin.zip vs apache-ignite-1.5.0.final-src.zip.&lt;/p&gt;

